P StarPath():
P   1. Create structure (array) to hold open set
P   2. Create structure (hashmap) to hold visited list
P   3. Call NearestNeighbor() to set origin
P   4. Update origin g_cost
P   5. Update origin path_cost
P     a. g_cost + CalculateEuclideanDistance()
P   6. Call StarPathBuild()
P 
P StarPathBuild():
P   0. Is current star the destination?
P     a. Yes? Return visited list
P   1. If curr star is not in visited list, add to visited list
P   2. GetNeighbors until there are at least 5 to choose from
P     a. Add each neighbor of current star to open set
P   3. Find Euclidean distance to each neighbor and update
P     a. tentative_g_cost = g_cost + distance(current, neighbor)
P       i. If tentative_g_cost < neighbor->g_cost
P         1. Update neighbor's path_cost
P         2. Update neighbor->came_from to current star
P   4. Heapify neighbors based on f_cost values
P   5. Assign heap root to temp position in prep for pop
P   6. Assign next node as heap root
P   7. Current_star = pop(temp node (old heap root))
P   8. Repeat steps 0 through 7 until exit condition is met
.
